{"id":"5b7d7fba37c620c4","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-equational-classifying-fibration.md","title":"条件等式的分类纤维化","display":"df-equational-classifying-fibration — 条件等式的分类纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-equational-classifying-fibration","aliases":["16-df-equational-classifying-fibration"],"display":"df-equational-classifying-fibration — 条件等式的分类纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]","[[16-df-algebraic-category]]","[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","[[16-lem-lawvere]]"],"source":"Example 3.5.2, pp.201–202 (PDF221–222); Theorem 3.6.3, pp.210–211 (PDF230–231); explicit local encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"source-construction-reviewed; local-proof-reviewed-not-machine-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-equational-classifying-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-equational-classifying-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equational-classifying-fibration — 条件等式的分类纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02dbbf0106916f6e\" href=\"?note=02dbbf0106916f6e\" title=\"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation\">16-df-conditional-equational-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4887bd10ad98ca45\" href=\"?note=4887bd10ad98ca45\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-category\">16-df-algebraic-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1559033331811923\" href=\"?note=1559033331811923\" title=\"16-lem-lawvere\">16-lem-lawvere</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 3.5.2, pp.201–202 (PDF221–222); Theorem 3.6.3, pp.210–211 (PDF230–231); explicit local encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-reviewed; local-proof-reviewed-not-machine-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为本书的简单多型代数签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、有限等式列表和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"02dbbf0106916f6e\" href=\"?note=02dbbf0106916f6e\" title=\"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation\">16-df-conditional-equational-derivation</a>。列表拼接记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\!+\">\\(+\\!+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C_\\Sigma=\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,\\varnothing)\">\\(\\mathbf C_\\Sigma=\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,\\varnothing)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4887bd10ad98ca45\" href=\"?note=4887bd10ad98ca45\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-category\">16-df-algebraic-category</a>，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 引起的命题等式加到基范畴的箭头相等中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\Gamma\\to\\Delta\">\\(\\rho:\\Gamma\\to\\Delta\\)</span> 是该基范畴的箭头，由项列表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda[\\rho]\">\\(\\Lambda[\\rho]\\)</span> 使用该项列替换。空公理的基本代数演算中可证等式仅是同一项树，故该表示唯一。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\">\\(a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)\">\\(b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)\\)</span> 为下文对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda\">\\(\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_H,M_H,s_H,t_H,e_H,c_H,\\mathcal E_H,p_H\">\\(O_H,M_H,s_H,t_H,e_H,c_H,\\mathcal E_H,p_H\\)</span> 在下文构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFib}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a>。所有量词限于所列集合编码。</li>\n<li>在等式伴随式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_i)_{i=1}^n\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\gamma_i)_{i=1}^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=(\\delta_j)_{j=1}^m\">\\(\\Delta=(\\delta_j)_{j=1}^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta\\)</span> 上的等式列表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i,w,d\">\\(x_i,w,d\\)</span> 在下文按项树和带源靶标签箭头正式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x_i]_\\varnothing\">\\([x_i]_\\varnothing\\)</span> 的下标语境和排序由该箭头的源与第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个位置决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall(\\sigma,s,t)\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\Lambda)\\ \\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}s=_\\sigma t,\\\\\nO_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\ \\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\nM_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\mid a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\in O_H,\\ b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)\\in O_H,\\ \\rho\\in\\mathbf C_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta),\\ \\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda[\\rho]\\},\\\\\ns_H\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq a,\\qquad t_H\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\ne_H(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,a,1_\\Gamma\\rangle\\quad(a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)),\\\\\nc_H(\\langle b,c,\\theta\\rangle,\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,c,\\theta\\circ\\rho\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal E_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_H,M_H,s_H,t_H,e_H,c_H\\rangle,\\\\\n(p_H)_0(\\Gamma,\\Theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma,\\qquad\n(p_H)_1\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\coloneqq\\rho,\\\\\np_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(p_H)_0,(p_H)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\rho^*(\\Delta,\\Lambda)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,\\Lambda[\\rho]),\\\\\n\\overline\\rho_{(\\Delta,\\Lambda)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\Gamma,\\Lambda[\\rho]),(\\Delta,\\Lambda),\\rho\\rangle,\\\\\n\\top^H_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,()),\\\\\n(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\wedge_H(\\Gamma,\\Lambda)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,\\Theta+\\!+\\Lambda).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall(\\sigma,s,t)\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\Lambda)\\ \\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}s=_\\sigma t,\\\\\nO_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\ \\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\nM_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\mid a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\in O_H,\\ b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)\\in O_H,\\ \\rho\\in\\mathbf C_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta),\\ \\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda[\\rho]\\},\\\\\ns_H\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq a,\\qquad t_H\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\ne_H(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,a,1_\\Gamma\\rangle\\quad(a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)),\\\\\nc_H(\\langle b,c,\\theta\\rangle,\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,c,\\theta\\circ\\rho\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal E_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_H,M_H,s_H,t_H,e_H,c_H\\rangle,\\\\\n(p_H)_0(\\Gamma,\\Theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma,\\qquad\n(p_H)_1\\langle a,b,\\rho\\rangle\\coloneqq\\rho,\\\\\np_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(p_H)_0,(p_H)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\rho^*(\\Delta,\\Lambda)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,\\Lambda[\\rho]),\\\\\n\\overline\\rho_{(\\Delta,\\Lambda)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\Gamma,\\Lambda[\\rho]),(\\Delta,\\Lambda),\\rho\\rangle,\\\\\n\\top^H_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,()),\\\\\n(\\Gamma,\\Theta)\\wedge_H(\\Gamma,\\Lambda)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma,\\Theta+\\!+\\Lambda).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nx_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle\\quad(i&gt;0),\\\\\nw&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta+\\!+\\Delta,\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta,([x_i]_\\varnothing)_{i=1}^{n+m}\\rangle,\\\\\nd&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta,\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta+\\!+\\Delta,\n([x_i]_\\varnothing)_{i=1}^{n+m}+\\!+([x_{n+j}]_\\varnothing)_{j=1}^m\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}^{H}_{\\Gamma,\\Delta}(\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta,\\Theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta+\\!+\\Delta,\n\\Theta[w]+\\!+((\\delta_j,x_{n+j},x_{n+m+j}))_{j=1}^m),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFib}(p_H)&amp;,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Eq}^{H}_{\\Gamma,\\Delta}\\dashv d^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nx_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle\\quad(i&gt;0),\\\\\nw&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta+\\!+\\Delta,\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta,([x_i]_\\varnothing)_{i=1}^{n+m}\\rangle,\\\\\nd&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta,\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta+\\!+\\Delta,\n([x_i]_\\varnothing)_{i=1}^{n+m}+\\!+([x_{n+j}]_\\varnothing)_{j=1}^m\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}^{H}_{\\Gamma,\\Delta}(\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta,\\Theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma+\\!+\\Delta+\\!+\\Delta,\n\\Theta[w]+\\!+((\\delta_j,x_{n+j},x_{n+m+j}))_{j=1}^m),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFib}(p_H)&amp;,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Eq}^{H}_{\\Gamma,\\Delta}\\dashv d^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>新建前检索本书 conditional-equational、algebraic-category、Eq-fibration、DTT term-model：前者只有推导闭包，代数范畴将命题等式商入基底，DTT项模型的语境和类型纤维不兼容，均不能充当这里的分类Eq-fibration。需要供模型扩张和后续条件等式语义复用，故独立补建；未引用书外原子。</p>\n<p>构造依据为原书 Example3.5.2（印刷201–202，PDF221–222）。自反性和cut给纤维预序；替换与cut给总范畴复合封闭及范畴律。每个底箭头至多有一个给定源靶的提升，所以总投影忠实。所列重索引箭头为笛卡尔箭头：任意因式分解的唯一介体由替换结合律给出；重索引严格保持空列表和拼接。基范畴的有限积是语境拼接。</p>\n<p>等式左伴随以复制位置的相等补入假设。逐个应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1559033331811923\" href=\"?note=1559033331811923\" title=\"16-lem-lawvere\">16-lem-lawvere</a>，并在需要时交换语境位置，得到所列伴随；同一证明允许任意额外假设列表，故给Frobenius。参数替换与复制位置相等相容，给参数BC。空列表的情形也成立。以上是对局部编码的证明复核，未经机器检查；没有把纤维中的互相可推导提升为基底中的箭头相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"02dbbf0106916f6e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-lem-lawvere","status":"resolved","id":"1559033331811923","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-lem-lawvere]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"02dbbf0106916f6e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为本书的简单多型代数签名，$H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$，$\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$、有限等式列表和 $\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}$ 采用 [[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]。列表拼接记为 $+\\!+$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-